OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fwindy with outbreaks of rain in the
OL,7,Fevening, occasionally heavy. Rain
OL,8,Fclearing Orkney overnight and becoming
OL,9,Flighter for Shetland, but north
OL,10,Fbacking northwest winds remaining
OL,11,Ffresh.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FOvernight rain and stronger
OL,14,Fwinds soon clearing Shetland.
OL,15,FOtherwise a dry day with variable
OL,16,Fcloud and some bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
