OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright spells on Sunday and Monday but
OL,7,Falso a few showers at times, rain
OL,8,Fspreading east later Monday. Becoming
OL,9,Fbreezy with scattered occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy showers on Tuesday.
